mycrew-specialists

The skills `visual-language` and `interface-writing` are derivative works of the
`frontend-design` skill from Anthropic's official Claude Code plugin collection,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in
LICENSE beside this file.

Both were rewritten rather than copied: the guidance was recast into this repo's
skill shape (a bold demand per line), split along the seam between what a look
must be and what its words must do, and retargeted from single-page design at a
product with a visual language that already exists. The calibration against
machine-default palettes, the four-part direction, the quality floor and the
interface-copy guidance originate in that skill.

`design-sync` and `designer` are original to this repository.
